        "original_id": "2b5931be-bb7e-5a5c-8096-61c4def017d5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James John Liautaud, Jimmy John Liautaud\n- Companies: Jimmy John's\n- Roles: founder, chairman, majority owner\n- Places: Champaign, Illinois, Alaska, Hawaii, Connecticut, Maine, New Hampshire, Vermont\n\nFacts:\n- James John Liautaud was born on January 12, 1964.\n- James John Liautaud is the founder, chairman, and majority owner of Jimmy John's.\n- Jimmy John's was founded by Jimmy John Liautaud in 1983.\n- Jimmy John's is headquartered in Champaign, Illinois.\n- Within 30 years of its founding, Jimmy John's grew to more than 2,500 locations.\n- Jimmy John's had locations in every U.S. state except Alaska, Hawaii, Connecticut, Maine, New Hampshire, and Vermont.",
